{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14764","headline":"送赵真长归夏县旧山依阳徵君读书 · 卢纶","name":"送赵真长归夏县旧山依阳徵君读书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临杯忽泫然，非是恶离弦。\n尘陌望松雪，我衰君少年。\n幽僧曝山果，寒鹿守冰泉。\n感物如有待，况依回也贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}